  "adaptations": [
    "Inference body and mirror_rgb copied from native main.cpp/cli_defaults.hpp; direct settings structure replaces CLI parsing.",
    "OSC sender replaced by a bounded latest-frame queue carrying NtFrame data.",
    "Preview receives host-dispatched events; never polls or quits the host SDL runtime.",
    "Camera permission denied uses the SDL3 integer API (< 0).",
    "Camera acquisition waits for SDL permission resolution (0 pending, < 0 denied) before requesting frames; the wait remains cancellable.",
